{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Demo of Clown Camp, a first person horror game inspired and styled after the low-poly classics of the late 1990s. Play the opening section of the game (~40 minutes) as you begin to explore this creepy campground and all of its mysteries. Search between bunk beds and tents for keys and clues. Armed only with a flashlight at first, your best bet is to run if confronted by any of the deranged clowns lurking in the woods. Fight them if you must, but, in true 90's horror game fashion, your number one goal is to <i>survive</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full game coming soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011730?t=1758058631","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011730?t=1758058631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011730/29dadea0acc07ed064d1419766bc09643aca10c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758058631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011730/29dadea0acc07ed064d1419766bc09643aca10c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758058631","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Settings in the game are very dark and isolated. Strong atmosphere of fear. Blood and gore is limited to pixelated particle effects and a red screen overlay upon taking damage, but can be toggled off in the options menu (or color swapped to green)."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Demo of Clown Camp, a first person horror game inspired and styled after the low-poly classics of the late 1990s. Play the opening section of the game (~40 minutes) as you begin to explore this creepy campground and all of its mysteries. Search between bunk beds and tents for keys and clues. Armed only with a flashlight at first, your best bet is to run if confronted by any of the deranged clowns lurking in the woods. Fight them if you must, but, in true 90's horror game fashion, your number one goal is to <i>survive</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full game coming soon.</p>","developers":["Ghostie Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3765700","name":"Clown Camp"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011730/63a8ee18c0db32171c9116810bc6fb307adb5fdb/header.jpg?t=1758058631","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Mint 21<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193328,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193328/movie480.mp4?t=1757519964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193328/movie_max.mp4?t=1757519964"},"name":"TeaserTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257193328/acaccbdc818d2849fbe6160c37b1cb8ed0db6033/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757519964","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193328/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757519964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193328/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757519964"}}],"name":"Clown Ca